This project is called eth-exchange-lab.

It is a Go + Ethereum + Solidity project for learning and demonstrating how a crypto exchange backend can interact with Ethereum.

Main domains:
- Wallets
- Deposits
- Withdrawals
- Ledger
- Orders
- Trades
- Matching engine
- Blockchain scanner
- Smart contracts

The backend language is Go.
The smart contract language is Solidity.
User-facing documentation must be Persian.

The project should be runnable locally with Docker Compose and Anvil.
The project should also include production-readiness documentation, but production behavior must be disabled by default.

Plan documents are archived under docs/plans/ with sequential numbering (00001+).
